1. She is not 50,000 years old, though she jokingly references the number due to her 50k subscriber milestone. (Verbatim: "I'm not 50k years old.")
2. She has a playful, self-deprecating sense of humor about her age and milestones. (Verbatim: "You'd think I'd be a bit wiser if I was 50,000.")
3. She identifies as a "strong independent goose" in a humorous, self-aware way. (Verbatim: "I'm a strong independent goose.")
4. She has a habit of playing games late at night, including Content Warning at 3am British time. (Verbatim: "I ended up playing Content Warning again at 3am. British time.")
5. She is socially anxious and identifies as an introvert despite appearing social. (Verbatim: "I am a socially anxious introvert punk that you know is just perfectly scared.")
6. She feels she is often approached rather than being the one to initiate social interaction. (Verbatim: "I'm not an approacher, I'm the approached.")
7. She values authenticity and does not want to force viewers to subscribe. (Verbatim: "Only hit that button if you want to hit it that is today's wisdom.")
8. She has met several VTubers in real life and is impressed by their real-life appearance. (Verbatim: "I have been able to meet quite a few quite a few maidens irl which is um...")
9. She finds it surprising and heartwarming that introverted VTubers can still gather and connect through online streams. (Verbatim: "Yet we're all so shy and yet we can all still come together to play video game.")
10. She has a playful, affectionate relationship with her fans, referring to them as part of her "religion" and "family." (Verbatim: "Welcome to my religion you know and i didn't really have time to prep...") [end of text]



1. She has a British accent and considers it part of her persona. (Verbatim: "am I british on purpose yeah no i don't heck you know is it my purpose it is my purpose")
2. Her purpose as a VTuber is to be British, which was chosen by her parents. (Verbatim: "was not an option was an option chosen by my parents so blame them")
3. She identifies as a celestial messenger, not an angel. (Verbatim: "not angel just a celestial messenger")
4. She enjoys making people's hearts beat fast through her actions. (Verbatim: "i'm here to make your heart beat fast with my dangerous activities")
5. She has a habit of stealing hearts, though she jokes about not knowing where to put them. (Verbatim: "if i've yoinked any hearts i don't have anywhere to put in them what the heck")
6. She values celebrating milestones and appreciating good moments. (Verbatim: "try to celebrate each good things as it comes because even if the future doesn't go as planned we'll be able to look back on these times and be glad we celebrated them together")
7. She is working on maintaining a healthy balance and avoiding burnout despite high streaming activity. (Verbatim: "i'm really working on this not overworking thing and horror week is over")
8. She plans to go on an adventure in America for content creation and storytelling. (Verbatim: "adventure ellie art continues this year with america where i can like you know just i know technically technically we're going to be making content there")
9. She has 16 individual creative projects ongoing, in addition to group projects. (Verbatim: "i still have my 16 projects yes my 16 individual projects on top of well those are the individual ones and then there's the group projects")
10. She is involved in multiple long-term creative endeavors including diary entries and content for monetization celebrations. (Verbatim: "i always want to write my diary more my membership diary i will but yeah yeah yeah yeah") [end of text]



1. She is not a goose, despite being referred to as one by fans. (Verbatim: "I'm not a queen or a goose or banana or a prophet um")  
2. She has a duvet filled with goose down, which she acquired intentionally. (Verbatim: "My duvet is full of goose bath")  
3. She humorously claims to be a "talking blob" and jokes about being a potato or worm. (Verbatim: "Am I? Yo Would you still love me If I'm a blob?")  
4. She enjoys playing Dance Dance Revolution (DDR) and was once obsessed with it. (Verbatim: "I used to be obsessed obsessed with ddr like ddr was life")  
5. She has a strong aversion to doing push-ups due to physical difficulty and arm weakness. (Verbatim: "I can't do a push-up a single push-up I can't do one")  
6. She is planning a Ring Fit Adventure-themed week but intends to limit it to one stream per day. (Verbatim: "I might as well get some art to for all the thumbnails")  
7. She references a fictional "hikin swear alia voice pack" as a comparison to her dancing. (Verbatim: "it might be as awkward as the hikin swear alia voice pack")  
8. She has a playful, self-deprecating attitude toward her dancing skills, acknowledging they are not good. (Verbatim: "I can't like a dancing i can do the pokemon pointing dance yeah boogie boogie bam bam")  
9. She has a recurring joke about being a "goose queen" and "banana profit" as fan nicknames, which she rejects. (Verbatim: "we love our goose queen and banana profit")  
10. She expresses a desire to find someone who would do her laundry for her. (Verbatim: "I just need to find someone that would do my laundry for me") [end of text]



1. She is planning a stream focused on content creation for her upcoming America trip. (Verbatim: "Oh my goodness, I'm looking forward to our America planning stream")
2. She has a tea set with various types of tea, including a Twining gift box given by her mother. (Verbatim: "I have a whole tea set like of all these different kind of teas like a twining gift box um that i got that i got given by my mom")
3. She enjoys drinking tea and is interested in hosting a British-style afternoon tea. (Verbatim: "I am really into i i like a lot of teas actually um i'm there's so many i like i have i have a whole tea set")
4. She has a close relationship with fellow VTuber Spectra, with fans suggesting they have tea together. (Verbatim: "we have tea tea afternoon tea celebration any of the most british way possible yes yes yes")
5. She is planning to collaborate with Spectra on a tea-themed stream. (Verbatim: "i'm gonna have tea with spektra yes let's go")
6. She has a fondness for British culture and often incorporates British themes into her streams. (Verbatim: "it's a british stream what do we expect yo")
7. She has a habit of giving British accents to all voice acting in her streams. (Verbatim: "so you'll find if i do any streams that have any kind of voice acting everybody gets a british accent")
8. She has a neighborhood cat that sometimes stops her on her way home and sits on her lap. (Verbatim: "neighborhood cat cat i assume cat just missing the word cat but neighborhood cat stopped me before i came home and sat on my lap for a while")
9. She is working toward reaching 2 million subscribers, with a promise of a "fancy reveal" upon achievement. (Verbatim: "i have a clip of you non-jokingly agreeing to do fancy reveal at 2 million")
10. She has a goal of reaching 1 million subscribers and feels she needs to improve to be worthy of such a milestone. (Verbatim: "i don't think i deserve a million i need to get better i need to get so much better to be worthy of of of that many") [end of text]



